WEBVTT

00:07:57.392 --> 00:08:00.366
“A-a-a-a”. Juda yaxshi.

00:08:00.390 --> 00:08:02.108
Endi lablarni qizdiramiz.

00:08:02.132 --> 00:08:04.460
Endi: “ba”, “ba”, “ba”, “ba”,

00:08:04.484 --> 00:08:07.412
“ba”, “ba”, “ba”, “ba”. Zo’r.

00:08:07.436 --> 00:08:10.852
Endi esa: “Brr-r-r-r”

00:08:10.876 --> 00:08:12.402
– huddi yoshligimizdagidek.

00:08:12.426 --> 00:08:14.829
“Brr-r-r-r”. Endi lablaringiz jonlandi.

00:08:14.853 --> 00:08:16.504
Endi tilga o'tib, uni o’tkir:

00:08:16.528 --> 00:08:20.826
“la”, “la”, “la”, “la”,
“la”, “la”, “la”, “la”.

00:08:20.850 --> 00:08:23.041
Barakalla. Juda yaxshi qilyapsizlar.

00:08:23.065 --> 00:08:25.931
Endi gulduraydigan “r” – “R-r-r-r-r”.

00:08:25.955 --> 00:08:28.147
Huddi, tilingizda shampan vinosi bordek.

00:08:28.171 --> 00:08:30.467
Nihoyat, juda muhim joyga keldik.